---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Case Study — Feed Manufacturer">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container">
    <a href="/case-studies" class="back-link">← All Case Studies</a>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;"><span class="tag">Manufacturing</span><span style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--dim);">Client Engagement</span></div>
    <h1>From Paper Registers to<br/><span class="cyan">Remote-Ready Dashboards</span></h1>
    <p style="margin-top:16px;max-width:580px;">How a Nairobi-based animal feed manufacturer eliminated a week-long reporting process and gained full remote visibility into their business.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section s-alt"><div class="container">
    <span class="label">At a Glance</span>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:16px;">
      <div class="stat-box"><span class="stat-lbl">Reporting time</span><span class="stat-val">7 days → 1 hr</span></div>
      <div class="stat-box"><span class="stat-lbl">Delivery time</span><span class="stat-val">2 weeks</span></div>
      <div class="stat-box"><span class="stat-lbl">Engagement model</span><span class="stat-val">Retainer</span></div>
      <div class="stat-box"><span class="stat-lbl">Business access</span><span class="stat-val">Remote-ready</span></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 280px;gap:56px;align-items:start;">
    <div>
      <img src="/images/dashboards/all.jpg" alt="Manufacturing dashboard" style="width:100%;height:260px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;border-radius:var(--r-lg);border:1px solid var(--b-cyan);display:block;margin-bottom:36px;"/>
      <h2 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.4rem;">Client Background</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:16px;">Our client is a Nairobi-based manufacturer and distributor of animal feeds, serving the local agricultural market with approximately 10 product lines. Like many owner-operated SMEs in Kenya, the business was growing — but its data infrastructure had not kept pace.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:32px;">The owner was managing operations using a combination of paper registers and disconnected Excel files. No central system, no automated reporting, no real-time visibility.</p>
      <h2 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.4rem;">The Challenge</h2>
      <ul style="margin-left:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-bottom:32px;">
        <li style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.7;"><strong style="color:var(--white);">Raw material costs could not be tracked at the product level</strong> — no way to know which products were profitable.</li>
        <li style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.7;"><strong style="color:var(--white);">Monthly reporting took a full week</strong> — paper records, manual entry, reconciliation, before any analysis could begin.</li>
        <li style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.7;"><strong style="color:var(--white);">The owner could not run the business remotely</strong> — every decision required being physically present.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:20px;font-size:1.4rem;">What Erdem Built</h2>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;margin-bottom:32px;">
        <div style="border-left:2px solid var(--cyan);padding-left:18px;"><h3 style="color:var(--cyan);margin-bottom:6px;font-size:1rem;">1. Automated Data Pipeline</h3><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Python script connects to the operational database, cleans and standardizes data, appends to a master CSV. Runs automatically — no manual entry, no reconciliation, no human error.</p></div>
        <div style="border-left:2px solid var(--cyan);padding-left:18px;"><h3 style="color:var(--cyan);margin-bottom:6px;font-size:1rem;">2. Raw Material Cost Dashboard</h3><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Power BI report tracking raw material costs per product line — cost breakdowns, procurement inefficiencies, and margin pressure visible in real time.</p></div>
        <div style="border-left:2px solid var(--cyan);padding-left:18px;"><h3 style="color:var(--cyan);margin-bottom:6px;font-size:1rem;">3. Profit & Sales Tracking Dashboard</h3><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Live view of product-level profitability, sales trends, and expense tracking — replacing a week-long manual process with an always-current dashboard accessible from any device.</p></div>
      </div>
      <h2 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.4rem;">The Outcome</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:16px;">The most significant outcome was operational freedom. The owner now runs the business remotely — receiving up-to-date reports without needing to be on-site.</p>
      <p>What previously consumed a full week of staff time now takes under an hour, with the pipeline handling everything automatically. The client remains on an Erdem retainer.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;position:sticky;top:88px;">
      <div style="padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-lg);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);"><div style="font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:8px;">Sector</div><p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--white);">Manufacturing — Animal Feeds</p></div>
      <div style="padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-lg);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);"><div style="font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:8px;">Services Used</div><p style="font-size:0.87rem;color:var(--muted);">Business Dashboards & Analysis<br/>AI Agents & Data Automation</p></div>
      <div style="padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-lg);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);"><div style="font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:8px;">Stack</div><p style="font-size:0.87rem;color:var(--muted);">Power BI · Python · CSV Pipeline</p></div>
      <div style="padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--b-cyan);border-radius:var(--r-lg);background:rgba(0,212,224,0.04);"><h4 style="color:var(--white);font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:12px;">See what Erdem can build for you</h4><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-cyan" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;">Talk to Us →</a></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
<style>@media(max-width:900px){[style*="grid-template-columns:1fr 280px"],[style*="grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)"]{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr!important}}</style>
